{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301072","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301072","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430107201:1":{"text":"苦しくてもやるしかない！みんな、こうして一人前になったんだ。","source_cn":"累也要坚持，所有的学徒在成为正式工匠前都是这么过来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD105657D815D3C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430107202:1":{"text":"よし、これから窯出しの実演だ。窯出し前にやるべきことは？","source_cn":"接下来我要演示开炉了。我问你，开炉前要做什么准备？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC64D7718BE1DA7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430107203:1":{"text":"まず、ヘ、ヘクト様に、純粋な鉱石を、二つ捧げて、それから、砕いた鉱石を、窯に入れます……！","source_cn":"首先，向，向赫托献上两块，块最纯洁的矿石，接着，将碾碎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x173E177A04A77E40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1430107204:1":{"text":"正解だ！そのまま！ふいごを止めるな！","source_cn":"没错，继续拉风箱！不要停！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x678B2AB08DE5FD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"職人のハガルド","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学徒铁哥达":{"text":"弟子のテゴダ","source":"学徒铁哥达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}